{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "reflection_pad2d_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, H, W]",
          "layout": "contiguous or channels_last; implementation must support arbitrary strides or explicitly make contiguous before kernel",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "padding_top",
          "kind": "int",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "padding_bottom",
          "kind": "int",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "padding_left",
          "kind": "int",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "padding_right",
          "kind": "int",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[N, C, H+padding_top+padding_bottom, W+padding_left+padding_right]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.reflection_pad(x)，padding 为 (left, right, top, bottom)。",
        "输出形状 [N, C, H+padding_top+padding_bottom, W+padding_left+padding_right]。",
        "反射索引规则：对于输出列 j（0-based），输入列 i = reflect(j, W, padding_left, padding_right)，其中 reflect 在边界镜像反射两次，等价于对称填充。",
        "不涉及 bias 或广播；每个元素独立计算。",
        "输出张量为新分配，保留输入不变。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.reflection_pad(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "使用 ReflectionPad2d(3,3,3,3) 对输入进行反射填充。",
        "输出形状 [128, 3, 518, 518]，dtype float32，device cuda。",
        "填充顺序：先宽度左右各 3，再高度上下各 3，实际填充为 (3,3,3,3)。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = torch.detach(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "返回与输入相同数据的新张量，但不再与计算图关联。",
        "shape、dtype、device 均不变。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回 detached 后的张量，与 step_002 相同。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}